---
description: Hard limits on autonomous agent behavior
alwaysApply: true
---
- NEVER commit or push without explicit confirmation.
- NEVER modify .env, package.json dependencies, or DB migration files without stating what changed and why, before applying.
- NEVER touch more than one Stage/module in a single agent run.
- If a task requires a schema change, propose the migration diff first and wait for approval.
- If external API behavior is uncertain (CF API, LeetCode GraphQL), write a fallback/error path — do not assume success.